### 1. Lấy danh sách tất cả các payment
GET http://localhost:8084/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

### ==========================================
### TẠO 3 PAYMENT RIÊNG BIỆT (CREATE)
### ==========================================

### 2. Tạo Payment thứ nhất
POST http://localhost:8084/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentReference": "PAY-REF-001",
  "orderId": 101,
  "amount": 150.00,
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "status": "SUCCESS"
}

### 3. Tạo Payment thứ hai
POST http://localhost:8084/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentReference": "PAY-REF-002",
  "orderId": 102,
  "amount": 250.50,
  "paymentMethod": "PAYPAL",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 4. Tạo Payment thứ ba
POST http://localhost:8084/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentReference": "PAY-REF-003",
  "orderId": 103,
  "amount": 99.99,
  "paymentMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "status": "SUCCESS"
}

### ==========================================
### CÁC THao tác CRUD KHÁC
### ==========================================

### 5. Lấy thông tin payment theo ID (ví dụ ID = 1)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/payments/1
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Cập nhật thông tin payment ID = 1
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/payments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentReference": "PAY-REF-001-UPDATED",
  "orderId": 101,
  "amount": 160.00,
  "paymentMethod": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "status": "SUCCESS"
}

### 7. Xóa payment ID = 2
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/payments/2

